Store (#77): patches on top of COSMIC Store (pin 16b1667, epoch-1.11.0):

  git -C ~/src/cosmic-store checkout -B lapin-ux 16b1667
  git -C ~/src/cosmic-store am ~/lapin-ux/packaging/lapin-ux-store/*.patch

Every Lapin look here is gated on `lapin::enabled()` (src/lapin.rs: XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP
contains LapinUX, or LAPIN_UX_STORE=1). In COSMIC's own session the app is stock.
Packaged as lapin-store (replaces cosmic-store; see packaging/arch/PKGBUILD).
